@startuml
!include skin.iuml
actor "Worker\n(400-500 people)" as W
node "Fingerprint reader" as FR
node "On-prem server\nat the facility (single host, Linux)" as SRV {
  component "Spring Boot API\nSpring Security, REST, validation" as API
  component "DigitalPersona SDK\n(device attached to server)" as SDK
  database "PostgreSQL\n15-20 tables" as DB
  component "React dashboard +\nC# WebForms QR inventory" as UI
}
actor "Managers" as M
W --> FR : scan
FR --> SDK
SDK --> API : attendance event
API --> DB : Spring Data JPA\n+ raw SQL for reports
UI --> API : REST
W --> UI : scan QR on item\n(production inventory)
API --> M : daily report\nhours worked per person
note bottom of SRV
Monitoring: watch application performance on the server,
investigate spikes. Backups were manual.
end note
@enduml
